<% content_for :title, "This connection cannot be set up" %>

<div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold">This connection cannot be set up</h1>

  <p class="text-sm opacity-75">
    The application that sent you here described itself in a way this server
    will not accept, so nothing has been connected and nothing has been shared.
  </p>

  <div class="rounded-lg border border-base-content/15 bg-base-200 px-3 py-2">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs break-all"><%= @description %></p>
  </div>

  <p class="text-sm opacity-75">
    Nothing is wrong with your account. The application has to fix this.
  </p>
</div>
